  "contract_words": {
    "promise": "ClineMM owns and attempts to clean up each CommandJob's primary owned process group when the command completes or is cancelled. A CommandJob is considered cleanly terminal only after ClineMM establishes that the primary PGID is gone. If that postcondition cannot be established, the job terminates as containment_failed and ClineMM surfaces a runtime incident.",
